[Graphics:Pentagram Arcs]
The eight arcs that are put into the room of the pentagram once the objects of the quest
have been collected.
#UDGTABLE(default,centre,centre,centre,centre,centre,centre,centre,centre)
  { #N$80 | #SPRITE$80,attr=$47(pentagram-arc-1-colour) | #N$81 | #SPRITE$81,attr=$47(pentagram-arc-2-colour) | #N$82 | #SPRITE$82,attr=$47(pentagram-arc-3-colour) | #N$83 | #SPRITE$83,attr=$47(pentagram-arc-4-colour) }
  { #N$84 | #SPRITE$84,attr=$47(pentagram-arc-5-colour) | #N$85 | #SPRITE$85,attr=$47(pentagram-arc-6-colour) | #N$86 | #SPRITE$86,attr=$47(pentagram-arc-7-colour) | #N$87 | #SPRITE$87,attr=$47(pentagram-arc-8-colour) }
UDGTABLE#

[Graphics:Pentagram Stones]
The stones that go on the pentagram. Each has two types, which are used before
and after the stone has been put in place.
#UDGTABLE(default,centre,centre,centre,centre,centre,centre,centre,centre)
  { #N$90, #N$98 | #SPRITE$90,attr=$47(pentagram-stone-1-colour) | #N$91, #N$99 | #SPRITE$91,attr=$47(pentagram-stone-2-colour) | #N$92, #N$9A | #SPRITE$92,attr=$47(pentagram-stone-3-colour) | #N$93, #N$9B | #SPRITE$93,attr=$47(pentagram-stone-4-colour) }
  { #N$94, #N$9C | #SPRITE$94,attr=$47(pentagram-stone-5-colour) }
UDGTABLE#

[Graphics:Quest Objects]
The four objects that have to be collected. The inventory colours them by the lowest three
bits of the type of the object, as shown here, and the type goes up by #N$04 once the object has been collected.
#UDGTABLE(default,centre,centre,centre,centre,centre,centre,centre,centre)
  { #N$70 | #SPRITE$70,attr=$41(quest-object-70-colour) | #N$71 | #SPRITE$71,attr=$42(quest-object-71-colour) | #N$72 | #SPRITE$72,attr=$43(quest-object-72-colour) | #N$73 | #SPRITE$73,attr=$44(quest-object-73-colour) }
  { #N$74 | #SPRITE$74,attr=$45(quest-object-74-colour) | #N$75 | #SPRITE$75,attr=$46(quest-object-75-colour) | #N$76 | #SPRITE$76,attr=$47(quest-object-76-colour) | #N$77 | #SPRITE$77,attr=$47(quest-object-77-colour) }
UDGTABLE#

